# ARPS Considerations
We want to send data and probably be able to send things to the HAB, so we need a good transceiver/tracker
Tracker : https://shop.qrp-labs.com/lightaprs-w
  - Can report location, altitude, temp, and pressure
  - Can direct to amateur radio and needs to be powered by either solar panels, super capacitors, or AAA batteries
  - Data rate of 1 transmission per minute
  - Open source software
  - Arduino compatible 
  - Extendable 
Extensive Details : https://qrp-labs.com/lightaprs-w
